# The mpv sidecar is deliberately NOT committed yet. The only Windows build
# available upstream is GPLv2+, and bundling it would put a source-distribution
# obligation on every Grid release (see src-tauri/licenses/README.md). A local
# copy is fine for development; remove these rules once an LGPL build exists.
#
# tauri.windows.conf.json is ignored for the same reason and must land in the
# same commit as the binary: it registers bin/mpv as an externalBin, and Tauri's
# build script fails outright when that file is missing.
src-tauri/bin/mpv-*
src-tauri/tauri.windows.conf.json
